sequenceDiagram
  participant H as Known human
  participant A as Agent/host
  participant G as MCP gateway
  participant I as Entra/Intune
  participant P as OPA
  participant B as Credential broker
  participant OS as OS provider
  participant E as Evidence
  H->>A: Request protected enrichment
  A->>G: Call with delegated token
  G->>I: Validate actor and posture
  G->>P: Evaluate authority context
  P-->>G: Allow with obligations/permit
  G->>B: Select organisation credential
  B->>OS: Client-credentials provider call
  OS-->>G: Protected result
  G->>E: Decision, provider call and receipt
  G-->>A: Protected result; no public cache
